{%- doc -%}
  Bespoke hub/routing page for the "Tous les accessoires" collection
  (handle: tous-les-accessoires) — the page a visitor lands on from the
  nav's "Accessoires" entry without picking a specific range first.

  Deliberately NOT a product grid, unlike its three sibling pages
  (collection-vigilia-touch-shop / -elite-shop / -key-shop). This
  collection mixes 52 products across three mutually INCOMPATIBLE alarm
  ecosystems (Vigilia/Touch AM30x, Élite PA501Z, Key SA501) — showing
  them together risks a customer adding an accessory that won't work
  with their actual system. So the job here is routing (pick your
  system, then land on the right shop page) plus general education
  (what do these accessory types even do), not browsing/buying — no
  add-to-cart, no quantity steppers, no JS filtering, no cart-drawer
  wiring. Static page, on purpose.

  v2 design pass (more graphic/premium, per feedback): the hero carries
  a hand-built inline-SVG "protected zones" diagram — rooms as rounded
  rectangles, each with a sensor dot, dashed lines converging on a
  central hub — rather than photography (none of the three centrale
  units have consistent, comparable product photography available, and
  a home-security company's most characteristic image IS the idea of
  monitored zones reporting to a hub, so this is grounded in the
  subject, not decorative). It's the one deliberate visual risk on this
  page; the system cards and glossary stay disciplined around it.

  Copy corrections from the merchant: all three systems are
  subscription-free (not just Key) — stated once, in the hero, instead
  of as a per-card claim. Vigilia/Touch ships with either a touchscreen
  (4.3" or 7") or a keypad depending on model — the card describes both
  rather than asserting one screen size. Key's card copy ("simple et
  fiable") is lifted from that product's own description, not invented.

  The glossary is "decomposed" per feedback: each accessory family now
  lists its concrete sub-types as small tags (e.g. Détecteurs →
  Mouvement / Vibration / Fumée / Fuite d'eau) rather than just a
  one-line description, and reuses the exact same 6 category icons
  already drawn for the three shop pages for continuity across the page
  family.

  Prefixed `hub-` (distinct from the shop pages' `das-`/`vts-`) since
  this is a different kind of page, not another shop.
{%- enddoc -%}

<div id="shopify-section-{{ section.id }}" class="hub">
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');

    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .hub{
      --hub-navy:#0c1e4a;
      --hub-navy-deep:#071228;
      --hub-ink:#171b23;
      --hub-gray:#5b6270;
      --hub-paper:#f5f6fa;
      --hub-line:#dde3ec;
      --hub-green:#037e05;
      --hub-green-glow:#22c55e;
      --hub-mono:'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
      font-family:'Poppins', sans-serif;
      color:var(--hub-ink);
      background:#fff;
    }
    .hub *{box-sizing:border-box;}
    .hub .hub-wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}
    .hub svg{display:block;}

    /* ---- hero ---- */
    .hub-hero{position:relative;padding:64px 0 56px;overflow:hidden;}
    .hub-hero::before{
      content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;
      background-image:radial-gradient(var(--hub-line) 1.4px, transparent 1.4px);
      background-size:26px 26px;
      -webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 20%, #000 40%, transparent 100%);
      mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 20%, #000 40%, transparent 100%);
    }
    .hub-hero__inner{position:relative;z-index:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px;align-items:center;}
    @media (min-width:900px){.hub-hero__inner{grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:24px;}}
    .hub-hero__text{text-align:center;}
    @media (min-width:900px){.hub-hero__text{text-align:left;}}
    .hub-eyebrow{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
      font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;
      color:var(--hub-green);margin-bottom:16px;
    }
    .hub-eyebrow::before{content:"";width:14px;height:2px;background:var(--hub-green);}
    .hub-hero h1{
      font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1;margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(28px,4.2vw,46px);max-width:560px;color:var(--hub-navy-deep);
    }
    @media (min-width:900px){.hub-hero h1{margin:0;}}
    .hub-hero__sub{
      font-size:clamp(15px,1.6vw,17px);color:var(--hub-gray);
      max-width:520px;margin:18px auto 0;line-height:1.6;
    }
    @media (min-width:900px){.hub-hero__sub{margin:18px 0 0;}}
    .hub-hero__badge{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:22px;
      font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hub-navy);
      background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--hub-line);border-radius:999px;padding:8px 16px;
      box-shadow:0 8px 20px -16px rgba(7,18,40,.3);
    }
    .hub-hero__badge svg{color:var(--hub-green);flex-shrink:0;}

    /* ---- zone-map graphic (signature) ---- */
    .hub-map{width:100%;max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;}
    @media (min-width:900px){.hub-map{margin:0;}}
    .hub-map svg{width:100%;height:auto;}
    .hub-map__room{fill:#fff;stroke:var(--hub-line);stroke-width:1.6;}
    .hub-map__link{stroke:var(--hub-line);stroke-width:1.6;stroke-dasharray:3 5;fill:none;}
    .hub-map__sensor{fill:var(--hub-green-glow);stroke:#fff;stroke-width:2;}
    .hub-map__hub-ring{fill:none;stroke:var(--hub-green-glow);stroke-width:1.4;opacity:.35;transform-origin:210px 190px;animation:hub-ring 2.6s ease-out infinite;}
    .hub-map__hub{fill:var(--hub-navy);}
    .hub-map__hub-icon{stroke:#fff;stroke-width:1.6;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}
    @keyframes hub-ring{
      0%{transform:scale(.72);opacity:.5;}
      100%{transform:scale(1.15);opacity:0;}
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.hub-map__hub-ring{animation:none;opacity:.25;}}

    /* ---- system selector ---- */
    .hub-systems{padding:16px 0 76px;}
    .hub-systems__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;}
    @media (min-width:820px){.hub-systems__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px;}}

    .hub-system{
      position:relative;overflow:hidden;
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;
      border:1px solid var(--hub-line);border-radius:20px;padding:30px 26px 26px;background:#fff;
      transition:box-shadow .25s ease,transform .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;
    }
    .hub-system::before{
      content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:3px;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--hub-green),var(--hub-green-glow));
      transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .3s ease;
    }
    .hub-system:hover::before{transform:scaleX(1);}
    .hub-system:hover{
      box-shadow:0 24px 48px -28px rgba(7,18,40,.28);transform:translateY(-4px);
      border-color:var(--hub-navy);
    }
    .hub-system__top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;}
    .hub-system__icon{
      width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--hub-paper);color:var(--hub-navy);
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;
    }
    .hub-system__status{
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-family:var(--hub-mono);
      font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--hub-gray);
      margin-top:3px;
    }
    .hub-system__dot{
      width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--hub-green-glow);flex-shrink:0;
      box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(34,197,94,.18);
    }
    .hub-system__code{
      font-family:var(--hub-mono);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--hub-green);
    }
    .hub-system__name{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--hub-navy-deep);line-height:1.2;}
    .hub-system__desc{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--hub-gray);flex:1;}
    .hub-system__chip{
      align-self:flex-start;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hub-navy);
      background:var(--hub-paper);border:1px solid var(--hub-line);border-radius:999px;padding:5px 12px;
    }
    .hub-system__cta{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:4px;
      font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hub-navy);
    }
    .hub-system__cta svg{transition:transform .2s ease;}
    .hub-system:hover .hub-system__cta svg{transform:translateX(3px);}

    /* ---- glossary (decomposed) ---- */
    .hub-glossary{padding:60px 0 76px;background:var(--hub-paper);}
    .hub-glossary__head{text-align:center;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 40px;}
    .hub-glossary__head h2{
      font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,28px);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--hub-navy-deep);margin:0 0 10px;
    }
    .hub-glossary__head p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--hub-gray);line-height:1.6;margin:0;}

    .hub-glossary__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px;}
    @media (min-width:700px){.hub-glossary__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;}}
    @media (min-width:1020px){.hub-glossary__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}

    .hub-term{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--hub-line);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;}
    .hub-term__icon{
      width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:11px;background:var(--hub-paper);
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--hub-navy);margin-bottom:14px;
    }
    .hub-term__name{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--hub-ink);margin:0 0 6px;}
    .hub-term__desc{font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--hub-gray);margin:0 0 12px;}
    .hub-term__tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;}
    .hub-term__tag{
      font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--hub-navy);
      background:var(--hub-paper);border:1px solid var(--hub-line);border-radius:999px;padding:3px 10px;
    }

    .hub-note{
      display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;max-width:820px;margin:32px auto 0;
      padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;border-left:3px solid #f79009;border-radius:10px;
    }
    .hub-note svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;color:#9a6a00;}
    .hub-note p{margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--hub-ink);}

    .hub-system:focus-visible,.hub-system__cta:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--hub-navy);outline-offset:3px;}

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
      .hub-system{transition:none;}
      .hub-system::before{transition:none;}
      .hub-system__cta svg{transition:none;}
    }
  </style>

